This product is a Python re-imagining of the Pico-ROS pattern. It is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It is informed by and semantically compatible with:

  Pico-ROS (https://github.com/Pico-ROS/Pico-ROS-software)
    Copyright (c) 2025 Ubiquity Robotics
    Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License.
    The picoros / picoserdes / picoparams module structure and the parameter
    backend interface (ref/get/type/set/describe/list/prefixes) are modeled on
    Pico-ROS. No Pico-ROS source code is included; this is an independent
    Python implementation.

It depends on, and wraps, at runtime:

  zenoh_ros2_sdk (https://github.com/robotis-git/zenoh_ros2_sdk)
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
    Provides the CDR serialization, rmw_zenoh-compatible liveliness/discovery,
    type hashing, and pub/sub/service transport.
